   },
   {
    "ref": "AI 83",
    "name": "Alarm_Bitmap",
    "why": "All alert bits as one number"
   }
  ],
  "setup": [
   "BACnet IP (Annex J); Object_Identifier, Object_Name and Location of the device object are writable."
  ],
  "gotchas": [
   "The PICS gives no units; check each AI's Units property after connecting."
  ],
